  "goodToKnow": "Der Schrott is scrap metal: Altmetall und Schrott, der Schrottplatz (scrapyard). Casually, it means junk or rubbish: Das Handy ist Schrott (the phone is broken beyond repair), Der Film war Schrott. Ein Auto verschrotten means to scrap a car; in 2009 Germany paid a famous Abwrackprämie (scrappage bonus) of 2,500 euros for old cars. Schrottreif means fit only for scrap. It has no plural."
